      "writtenOn": "2022-07-07T19:01:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The usb_mux shim does currently require the `hpd-update` enum.  If the board dts file excludes the `hpd-update` property, then the `usb_mux.hpd_update` field is set to NULL.\nThis provides flexibility for enabling/disabling HPD updates.\n\n@tmichalec@google.com - why is `hpd-update` an enum property instead of a bool property?",
