      "writtenOn": "2022-07-08T12:31:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`hpd-update` is an enum to explicitly set the `hpd_update` function name. I wasn\u0027t sure if it is possible to have device that has one compatible but two or more different `hpd-update` functions to choose from. If it is true that there is only one `hpd-update` variant for one compatible, then `hpd-update` can be bool and the `usb_mux.hpd_update` would be set by some macro based on compatible.",
